  // Reverb presets (issue #329), namespace "sage": what a `reverb_zone` names. A prefab puts a zone in a
  // place, or a map brush entity with `"trigger" "1"` draws one:
  //   { "type": "prefab", "id": "hut_room", "parts": { "reverb_zone": { "reverb": "sage:room" } } }
  // A game adds its own `reverb` records, or tunes these with "patch". The values are OpenAL EFX's
  // standard reverb (the efx-presets table's ROOM, CONCERTHALL, CAVE and PLAIN); `mix` is how much of it
  // is heard.
